  unitName: Imperial Smith Galant
  unitId: 10145
  unitNumber: 839
  description: A former blacksmith from the Agni Empire. After entrusting Dandelga
    to a hero, he once again headed towards the volcano in order to forge a large
    amount of weapons with which to supply those retaliating against the gods. Since
    the God Army's blacksmiths were supplying the deities with very strong arms as
    well, Galant saw them as the greatest threat. Therefore, he tried to siege the
    volcano, eventually getting into an intense skirmish with a single blacksmith.
    Making the firepower of the volcano his own, it is said that a demon-like shadow
    began manifesting behind him after he created countless weapons for battle.
  summonDesc: If you can Summon a top blacksmith,<br>it must mean you're a top Summoner.<br>We're
    the best team ever!
  fusionDesc: The fire forges my soul!<br>More, make it burn brighter!<br>The flames
    can still grow much bigger!
  evoDesc: The path of the smith is never over!<br>I still have to prove<br>that
    I'm the best blacksmith around!
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
